abstract: >-
        An educational Streamlit application for tuberculosis symptom and
        risk-factor screening, burden and care-cascade estimation, Wells-Riley
        airborne transmission modeling, and population attributable fraction
        calculation. Not a diagnostic tool and not clinically validated.
  keywords:
    -tuberculosis
    -python
    -streamlit
    -population attributable fraction
    -Wells-Riley 
    -epidemiology
